someone passed out here?","nextNodeIds":[752580102]},{"nodeId":752580102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3913841498,"text":"Heeey! Can you hear Paimon? Are you okay?","nextNodeIds":[752580103]},{"nodeId":752580103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":4239526018,"text":"You help the man up, and he slowly regains consciousness...","nextNodeIds":[752580104]},{"nodeId":752580104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":4259928546,"text":"Ow, ow, ow...","nextNodeIds":[752580105,752580106]},{"nodeId":752580105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2558079954,"text":"Hello. Have you had too much to drink?","nextNodeIds":[752580107]},{"nodeId":752580107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":2895932354,"text":"Head hurts... How'd I... Lemme think...","nextNodeIds":[752580108]},{"nodeId":752580108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":468215370,"text":"Ah! I remember! I think I got knocked out by someone... but I didn't see who. Wait... It wasn't you, was it!?","nextNodeIds":[752580109]},{"nodeId":752580109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2186519906,"text":"Hey! We're the ones who helped you up! You should be thanking us!","nextNodeIds":[752580110]},{"nodeId":752580110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":3960404250,"text":"Oh, sorry... Uhm, I work at the Me & Dew bar. I was originally going to deliver some goods to the port in the north... A merchants' association from Nod-Krai bought some Aphimead from us, you see.","nextNodeIds":[752580111]},{"nodeId":752580111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":2179317610,"text":"Oh! No! The Aphimead! It's gone! Did they steal it? Wait, YOU didn't steal it, did you!?","nextNodeIds":[752580112]},{"nodeId":752580112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":2160094866,"text":"Why do you keep accusing us!?","nextNodeIds":[752580113]},{"nodeId":752580113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":101787314,"text":"Oh, right. Sorry, sorry... I guess it must be the dizziness. Thanks, you two. I need to head back to the bar and tell them what happened...","nextNodeIds":[752580114]},{"nodeId":752580114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","textMapHash":1168739858,"text":"If there really are bandits on the loose, you should probably stay away from the northern port. It could be dangerous.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":752580106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2435294578,"text":"Do you need me to take you home?","nextNodeIds":[752580107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7525801,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133522044"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_NOTIFY_GROUP_LUA"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["21981"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7525801],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21981,"speakerName":"Unconscious Employee","count":7},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"s